{
  "source": "board.status = liveBoard.status() ({ mode, configured, locked, pinRequired }) with board-host.mjs's fresh-install rule: an unconfigured board takes pinRequired from settings.requireBoardPin (!== false), otherwise the envelope's own type decides. Electron parity: src/main/board-live.mjs:112 + main.js:1320-1371.",
